        "TileImage": "$($repository 8f6a403f-51da-49ab-939e-34aa98f1d934).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. The citizens of Sapienza are tired of 2nd hand smoke. Perhaps eliminating a few of these chainsmokers in an &quot;EXPLOSIVE &quot; way will send a clear message. Bring a long a wrench and an explosive powder to get the job done and please dress the &quot; Classic 47&quot; way. The clock is ticking. Good luck.\r\rCreated by: Ozzygrl",
